Made lake-trip, with you as Sam.
Send this link to the people you want in it. It works for a day, while this computer is on:

  svrngs://join/<the token>

or, to open it in a browser:

  http://localhost:56384/#<the token>

On a phone, each app opens at an address of its own under localhost:56384, which can see which app is opened.

lake-trip's folder is /tmp/c-rerun/sam/svrngs/lake-trip: what anyone in lake-trip puts there reaches this computer, and what you put there reaches theirs.

Leave this running; Ctrl-C stops it.
